# QuestDaily

Read `PROJECT.md` before generating code. This is a game-like quest app, not a
generic to-do list.

## Scope

Build one vertical slice at a time. Do not implement Auth, Quest CRUD, or the
gamification engine until the user confirms the current phase.

Lead differentiators (first-class, not extras): Quest Chains, Boss Battles,
earned streak freeze tokens, adaptive difficulty, weekly cosmetic Seasons.

## Stack

Next.js App Router, TS strict, Tailwind, shadcn restyled to the QuestDaily
look, Prisma + Postgres, Auth.js v5, Zustand, TanStack Query, Framer Motion,
Zod, Server Actions only for mutations.

Keep XP/level/streak math in `lib/gamification/` with zero framework imports.
Every gamification change writes an `Event` row.

## Routes

`(marketing)` landing, `(auth)` sign-in, `(app)` dashboard / quests /
quests/[id] / profile / achievements. Mobile-first; bottom nav in the app shell.
